  "steps": [
    "Heat oil in a large skillet. Cook carrots, onion, salt, and pepper until softened, 5-7 min.",
    "Add ground turkey, cook until browned, about 3 min.",
    "Stir in garlic, oregano, and red pepper flakes for 1 minute.",
    "Pour in wine, scrape up browned bits. Add crushed tomatoes, tomato paste, and milk.",
    "Bring to a boil, reduce heat, simmer 10 minutes. Adjust seasoning.",
